  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Snow pines grow well under him, snow willows planted two years earlier already number over ten thousand, and that year he produces close to three hundred rank five Gu with surplus ice path and water path Gu left to sell. He raises six snowman tribes, sells snowmen in treasure yellow heaven after finding that trade more profitable than icy tears, and after decades as rank six still has no Immortal Gu. When Ma tribe requests help in the Imperial Court struggle, he sends Gu worms and battle troop D with the snowman Gu Masters Xue Wa, Xue Mi, and Xue Ming.",
      "chapters": [
        537
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_no_gu",
        "fac_ma_tribe",
        "loc_imperial_court",
        "sys_gu_worms",
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "char_xue_wa"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is tall and thin, with snow white hair that reaches the ground, clothed in a light blue gown, and has deep blue eyes.",
      "chapters": [
        537
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He controls the seventh peak of Snowy Mountain blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        677
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "seventh-peak",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_snowy_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among seven Gu Immortals invading Lang Ya blessed land, Fang Yuan targets him as the lowest cultivation and likely lowest battle strength, remembering an earlier loss of Xue Song Zi to Fang Yuan’s strength path phantom army. He is a snow path Gu Immortal using Qin Bai Sheng’s lent rank six ice heart Immortal Gu and a set of immortal killer moves built on it. After he freezes the yellow jade lion with ice heart lock, a strength path giant hand seizes him; he detonates ice armor to push one hand back, then a second overhead slap beats him into meat paste.",
      "chapters": [
        874
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lang-ya-invasion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_qin_bai_sheng",
        "gu_ice_heart_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later soul search of Hei Cheng tells Fang Yuan that Xue Song Zi died in the initial period of the hundred days battle.",
      "chapters": [
        990
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lang-ya-invasion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_cheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A soul search in Fang Yuan’s previous life finds Xue Song Zi’s soul tampered with by Shadow Sect’s side, so no Shadow Sect information comes out, though his growth during life, his cultivation insights, and his other experiences are all probed out.",
      "chapters": [
        1040
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lang-ya-invasion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shadow_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After his death, a demonic path Gu Immortal, Shadow King, joins Snowy Mountain blessed land of his own accord and takes the seventh peak.",
      "chapters": [
        1255
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "seventh-peak-succession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
